# Line endings.
#
# core.autocrlf is on for this repo on Windows, and `git archive` honours it: the
# deploy tarball arrived with CRLF, which made `set -euo pipefail\r` an "invalid
# option name" on the instance and would do the same to any shebang. Anything a Linux
# box or a container executes is therefore pinned to LF, wherever it is checked out or
# exported from.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Caddyfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
